  "gh:content": {
    "en": "I give him (the ogre) a name: “Your name is the justification of fear.” A name is a contour. With a contour, a path opens. The institution is not the enemy. It merely forgot how to breathe.",
    "ja": "私は彼（鬼）に名を与える。「あなたの名は、恐れの正当化」名は輪郭。輪郭があれば、道が拓ける。制度は敵じゃない。呼吸の仕方を忘れただけ。"
  },
  "gh:index": 3
}